20%20%20%20--save_steps%20100%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--save_total_limit%202%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--logging_steps%205%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_length%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--output_dir%20output%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--system%20'You%20are%20a%20helpful%20assistant.'%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--warmup_ratio%200.05%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--dataloader_num_workers%204%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_author%20swift%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--model_name%20swift-robot%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--gradient_checkpointing_kwargs%20'%7B%5C%22use_reentrant%5C%22%3A%20false%7D'%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jFssp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"daK4t\" id=\"daK4t\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf4ce7cb\" id=\"ubf4ce7cb\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">debug微调</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua0e044ac\" id=\"ua0e044ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4681f4df\" id=\"u4681f4df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以使用以下方式进行debug，这与使用命令行微调是等价的，但此方式不支持分布式。微调命令行运行入口可以查看</span><a href=\"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-swift/blob/main/swift/cli/sft.py\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufc3f0dd8\" id=\"ufc3f0dd8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf7f2e446\" id=\"uf7f2e446\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-fg)\">这里</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u48f9c2d2\" id=\"u48f9c2d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20swift.llm%20import%20sft_main%2C%20TrainArguments%5Cnresult%20%3D%20sft_main(TrainArguments(%5Cn%20%20%20%20model%3D'Qwen%2FQwen2.5-7B-Instruct'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20train_type%3D'lora'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20dataset%3D%5B'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-zh%23500'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'AI-ModelScope%2Falpaca-gpt4-data-en%23500'%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'swift%2Fself-cognition%23500'%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20torch_dtype%3D'bfloat16'%5Cn))%5Cnprint(result)%20%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yziOO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"IpveP\" id=\"IpveP\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub937625a\" id=\"ub937625a\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">模型合并</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20Since%20%60output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%60%20is%20trained%20by%20swift%20and%20contains%20an%20%60args.json%60%20file%2C%5Cn%23%20there%20is%20no%20need%20to%20explicitly%20set%20%60--model%60%2C%20%60--system%60%2C%20etc.%2C%20as%20they%20will%20be%20automatically%20read.%5Cnswift%20export%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--merge_lora%20true%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eUGQx%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"t1PO5\" id=\"t1PO5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50ccecd7\" id=\"u50ccecd7\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">模型推理</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4f68c2a6\" id=\"u4f68c2a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55ad34d9\" id=\"u55ad34d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用CLI对LoRA训练的checkpoint进行推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--stream%20true%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XfRdt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u5a2f8b06\"><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"uc131508d\" id=\"uc131508d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e531f3b\" id=\"u7e531f3b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">adapters文件夹中包含了训练的参数文件</span><code data-lake-id=\"u9e21344f\" id=\"u9e21344f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u36519765\" id=\"u36519765\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">args.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u529e64fa\" id=\"u529e64fa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，因此不需要额外指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u80a9b9c0\" id=\"u80a9b9c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7bfe06b\" id=\"ue7bfe06b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5e0eab87\" id=\"u5e0eab87\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，</span><code data-lake-id=\"u49abd035\" id=\"u49abd035\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a11756b\" id=\"u7a11756b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--system</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud14ac179\" id=\"ud14ac179\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，swift会自动读取这些参数。如果要关闭此行为，可以设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue81355d8\" id=\"ue81355d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ffd46f0\" id=\"u9ffd46f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--load_args false</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u82cdc8c1\" id=\"u82cdc8c1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"udc8c61fe\" id=\"udc8c61fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90964df3\" id=\"u90964df3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">如果使用全参数训练，请使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucb490534\" id=\"ucb490534\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3d93d01\" id=\"uc3d93d01\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--model</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0c33fc64\" id=\"u0c33fc64\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">替代</span><code data-lake-id=\"udf17b98c\" id=\"udf17b98c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7a5f96c6\" id=\"u7a5f96c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--adapters</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u60dd54cc\" id=\"u60dd54cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">指定训练的checkpoint目录。更多参考。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"uc948bfcf\" id=\"uc948bfcf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c56187d\" id=\"u7c56187d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7747f4b4\" id=\"u7747f4b4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueabf35fb\" id=\"ueabf35fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift app</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u032ae0fd\" id=\"u032ae0fd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">替代</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4b77e900\" id=\"u4b77e900\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8d418996\" id=\"u8d418996\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">swift infer</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud43746e4\" id=\"ud43746e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行界面推理。</span></li><li fid=\"u6808bf71\" data-lake-id=\"u1f4ab26e\" id=\"u1f4ab26e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65fa9295\" id=\"u65fa9295\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以选择对LoRA进行merge（额外指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5271d203\" id=\"u5271d203\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud73c43ba\" id=\"ud73c43ba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--merge_lora true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u94e297ef\" id=\"u94e297ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">），然后指定</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue86141ba\" id=\"ue86141ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3fedcab\" id=\"ue3fedcab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--infer_backend vllm/lmdeploy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4053ea18\" id=\"u4053ea18\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行推理加速。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u7725fcb3\" id=\"u7725fcb3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72359add\" id=\"u72359add\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">对数据集中的验证集进行批量推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--load_data_args%20true%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_batch_size%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mzmYA%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u2c011da7\"><li fid=\"u9353fec2\" data-lake-id=\"ue21d4700\" id=\"ue21d4700\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d1c232d\" id=\"u5d1c232d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">你可以设置</span><code data-lake-id=\"ub305ebb2\" id=\"ub305ebb2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f4533f0\" id=\"u1f4533f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--max_batch_size 8</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uacab7432\" id=\"uacab7432\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">，从而使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue5b115ce\" id=\"ue5b115ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u38092193\" id=\"u38092193\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--infer_backend pt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u918d5ea0\" id=\"u918d5ea0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行批量处理。若使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubbe1fe71\" id=\"ubbe1fe71\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd5371b8\" id=\"ubd5371b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">infer_backend vllm/lmdeploy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua32bdb4a\" id=\"ua32bdb4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">则无需指定，会进行自动batch。</span></li><li fid=\"u9353fec2\" data-lake-id=\"u50ff7262\" id=\"u50ff7262\"><code data-lake-id=\"ufb2f0e75\" id=\"ufb2f0e75\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68d0ef4d\" id=\"u68d0ef4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--load_data_args true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0396da45\" id=\"u0396da45\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">会额外读取训练存储参数文件</span><code data-lake-id=\"u00cbc99f\" id=\"u00cbc99f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u393db13b\" id=\"u393db13b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">args.json</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufe0f7c2e\" id=\"ufe0f7c2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">中的数据参数。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6f436f05\" id=\"u6f436f05\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9ac5aec\" id=\"ud9ac5aec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">若想对额外的测试集进行推理，而不使用训练时的验证集，使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7d549100\" id=\"u7d549100\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3b19bf8\" id=\"uf3b19bf8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">--val_dataset &lt;dataset_path&gt;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub4c9ad98\" id=\"ub4c9ad98\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">进行推理：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES%3D0%20%5C%5C%5Cnswift%20infer%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--adapters%20output%2Fvx-xxx%2Fcheckpoint-xxx%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--infer_backend%20pt%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--temperature%200%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_new_tokens%202048%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--val_dataset%20%3Cdataset-path%3E%20%5C%5C%5Cn%20%20%20%20--max_batch_size%201%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G7aAf%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uebf4c10f\" id=\"uebf4c10f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae5d47ae\" id=\"uae5d47ae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 35, 40)\">使用Python对训练后LoRA推理的例子如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20os%5Cnos.environ%5B'CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES'%5D%20%3D%20'0'%5Cn%5Cn