7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B'role'%3A%20'user'%2C%20'content'%3A%20'%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E5%A5%BD%E5%90%83%E7%9A%84'%7D%2C%5D)%2C%5Cn%5D%5Cnresp_list%20%3D%20engine.infer(infer_requests%2C%20request_config)%5Cnquery0%20%3D%20infer_requests%5B0%5D.messages%5B0%5D%5B'content'%5D%5Cnprint(f'response0%3A%20%7Bresp_list%5B0%5D.choices%5B0%5D.message.content%7D')%5Cnprint(f'response1%3A%20%7Bresp_list%5B1%5D.choices%5B0%5D.message.content%7D')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LNvnD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u074617ed\" id=\"u074617ed\"><span data-lake-id=\"u797c4b2f\" id=\"u797c4b2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 2298, "description": "示例代码📎ddp-demo.zip数据并行数据并行，就是将数据集分为 N 份，分别装载到 N 个 GPU 节点中，每个 GPU 节点持有一个完整的模型副本，分别基于每个 GPU 中的数据去进行梯度求导。在 GPU0 上对每个 GPU 中的梯度进行累加，最后，再将 GPU0 聚合后的结果广播到...", "updated_at": "2025-05-20T04:21:50.000Z", "created_at": "2025-05-20T03:53:13.000Z", "id": 220384248, "status": 1}